## RBAC

The controller's ClusterRole grants:

| API group   | Resource           | Verbs                                       |
|-------------|--------------------|---------------------------------------------|
| `vmafx.dev` | `@PLURAL@`         | get, list, watch, create, update, patch     |
| `vmafx.dev` | `@PLURAL@/status`  | get, update, patch                          |
| `vmafx.dev` | `@PLURAL@/finalizers` | update                                   |

Extending the verb set requires an ADR per ADR-0714.

## Helm chart

Toggle the controller via `values.yaml`:

```yaml
operator:
  enabled: true
  controllers:
    @KIND_LOWER@:
      enabled: true
```

Disabled by default per ADR-0714 Stage 1 posture.

